/sourceText (Systems Administrator 4\054 Engineering Operations \174 USA \055 Remote \174 Netflix\012\012Systems Administrator 4\054 Engineering Operations\012\012USA \055 Remote\012\012Job Posting Date\012\01204\05517\0552026\012\012Job Requisition ID\012\012JR40095\012\012Teams\012\012Engineering\012\012Work Type\012\012Remote\012\012At Netflix\054 our mission is to entertain the world\056 Together\054 we are writing the next episode \055 pushing the boundaries of storytelling\054 global fandom and making the unimaginable a reality\056 We are a dream team obsessed with the uncomfortable excitement of discovering what happens when you merge creativity\054 intuition and cutting\055edge technology\056 Come be a part of what\220s next\056\012\012ROLE\012\012The Ntech Engineering Operations team at Netflix focuses on optimizing operational efficiency by streamlining and automating workflows\054 reducing overhead\054 and ensuring our systems scale effectively\056 We provide a broad portfolio of services across first\055 and third\055party enterprise systems and SaaS platforms including Google Workspace\054 Zendesk\054 and Slack\056 As a centralized team of operations experts\054 we aim to remove friction\054 simplify workflows\054 and provide technical solutions to Netflix employees so they can focus on bringing engaging stories to our members all over the world\056\012\012This engineering role is rewarding for people who have a passion for workflow automation\054 reducing operational overhead\054 and streamlining systems to scale effectively\056 You\220ll be a part of an established team focused on building robust operational practices around our first\055 and third\055party service and system portfolio while prioritizing engineering efforts to reduce toil\054 automate tasks\054 and enable the broader Netflix workforce\056 If this excites you\054 we invite you to bring your unique career and life experiences to enrich the culture and diversity of our team\056\012\012RESPONSIBILITIES\012\012Act as a high\055responsibility service owner for a broad range of enterprise applications\012\012Relentlessly pursue system and process improvements with a keen eye for how engineering solutions reduce toil and eliminate manual tasks\012\012Administer\054 manage\054 and configure a variety of internal tools and SaaS applications such as Google Workspace\054 Slack\054 and Zendesk\012\012Design\054 implement\054 and maintain scalable and reliable infrastructure to support our services\012\012Develop\054 test\054 and deploy API integrations between our platforms and web services\012\012Implement and improve monitoring and alerting systems to proactively identify and address potential issues\012\012Partner closely with Product Management and business teams to identify opportunities for process improvements\054 workflow efficiencies\054 and engineering solutions \050e\056g\056 self\055service tools to help our Support teams scale\051\012\012WE VALUE\012\012Exceptional strong problem\055solving and organization skills\012\012An ability to quickly form strong technical opinions and make data\055driven decisions\012\012Passion for engineering principles and developing high\055quality\054 impactful tools and applications\012\012Ability to thrive in a dynamic environment where needs constantly shift\054 while clearly articulating priorities and critical outcomes to your team\012\012Demonstrated sound judgment by taking a strategic approach to solving technical problems with a holistic view of the business impact\012\012A desire to learn\054 experiment\054 innovate\054 and engineer for scale\012\012A desire to be part of a close\055knit\054 high performing team that prioritizes collaboration\054 mutual support\054 and continuous improvement\012\012SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE\012\0123\053 years of experience in a Systems Engineer or similar role OR 3\053 years of experience in a Systems Specialist or Systems Administrator role\012\012Expertise managing enterprise software solutions like Slack\054 Google Workspace\054 and Zendesk\012\012Strong scripting and programming skills \050Python\054 Go\054 Java or JavaScript\057Node\056js\051\012\012Experience with using APIs to integrate and extend 1st\055 and 3rd\055party applications\012\012Experience with low\055code\057no\055code development platforms like Workato and Okta Workflows\012\012Experience with generative AI tools like Cursor\054 Claude Code\054 Claude Cowork\054 Codex\054 Gemini\054 and Antigravity\012\012Familiarity with generative AI concepts including MCP\054 RAG\054 context windows\054 token usage\054 system prompts\054 prompt engineering\054 and prompt injection\012\012Experience with identity and access management and authorization concepts and protocols including RBAC\054 SCIM\054 SAML\054 and OAuth\012\012Experience with cloud platforms like AWS and microservice architectures\012\012Experience with incident management and response\012\012Excellent communication \046 collaboration skills and a continuous improvement mindset\012\012Proven ability to cultivate relationships through influence\012\012Proven ability to assess complex issues and implement effective solutions\012\012Generally\054 our compensation structure consists solely of an annual salary\073 we do not have bonuses\056 You choose each year how much of your compensation you want in salary versus stock options\056 To determine your personal top of market compensation\054 we rely on market indicators and consider your specific job family\054 background\054 skills\054 and experience to determine your compensation in the market range\056 The range for this role is \044225\054000\05600 \055 \044360\054000\05600\056 This compensation range will vary based on location\056\012\012Netflix provides comprehensive benefits including Health Plans\054 Mental Health support\054 a 401\050k\051 Retirement Plan with employer match\054 Stock Option Program\054 Disability Programs\054 Health Savings and Flexible Spending Accounts\054 Family\055forming benefits\054 and Life and Serious Injury Benefits\056 We also offer paid leave of absence programs\056 Full\055time hourly employees accrue 35 days annually for paid time off to be used for vacation\054 holidays\054 and sick paid time off\056 Full\055time salaried employees are immediately entitled to flexible time off\056 See more details about our Benefits here\056\012\012Netflix is a unique culture and environment\056 Learn more here\056\012\012Inclusion is a Netflix value and we strive to host a meaningful interview experience for all candidates\056 If you want an accommodation\057adjustment for a disability or any other reason during the hiring process\054 please send a request to your recruiting partner\056\012\012We are an equal\055opportunity employer and celebrate diversity\054 recognizing that diversity builds stronger teams\056 We approach diversity and inclusion seriously and thoughtfully\056 We do not discriminate on the basis of race\054 religion\054 color\054 ancestry\054 national origin\054 caste\054 sex\054 sexual orientation\054 gender\054 gender identity or expression\054 age\054 disability\054 medical condition\054 pregnancy\054 genetic makeup\054 marital status\054 or military service\056\012\012Job is open for no less than 7 days and will be removed when the position is filled\056\012\012Netflix HouseAbout UsPrivacyCookie Preferences\012\012We use cookies to operate our services\056 We may also share information about your use of our site with partners who help us operate our business\056 Read more here or change your cookie preferences by selecting \217Learn more\220\056\012\012Privacy Preference Center\012\012General Description\012\012Essential Cookies\012\012Performance and Functionality Cookies\012\012Advertising Cookies\012\012General Description\012\012This cookie tool will help you understand the use of cookies on this website\054 and how you can control the use of these cookies\056\012\012Privacy settings in most browsers allow you to prevent your browser from accepting some or all cookies\054 notify you when it receives a new cookie\054 or disable cookies altogether\056 If your browser disables all cookies\054 then information will not be collected or stored via the cookies listed in this tool\056 This means that your use of the website may be impaired\056\012\012Please note that when you use this cookie tool to opt out of certain cookies\054 your opt out preferences are recorded by placing a cookie on your device\056 Therefore\054 your browser must be configured to accept cookies in order for your preferences to take effect\056 Also\054 if you delete or clear your cookies\054 or change your web browser\054 you will need to reset your cookie preferences\056\012\012For more information on our use of cookies\054 please visit the Cookies section of our Privacy Statement\056\012\012Essential Cookies\012\012Always Active\012\012These cookies are strictly necessary to provide our website\056 For example\054 we and our Service Providers may use these cookies to authenticate and identify visitors when they use our websites and applications so we can provide our service to them\056 They also help us to enforce our Terms of Use\054 prevent fraud and maintain the security of our services\056\012\012Lifespan\072 Lifespan\072 Most cookies are session cookies \050which are only active until you close your browser\051 or are cookies which are only active for one day\056 Some cookies are active for a longer time\054 ranging from 3 to 12 months\056 The cookies used to prevent fraud and maintain the security or our services are active for a maximum period of 24 months\056\012\012Performance and Functionality Cookies)
